Package: RCDC
Title: Robust Covariate-Assisted Community Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zeyu", "Hu", email = "zeyu.hu8888@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Zeyu Hu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zeyu Hu <zeyu.hu8888@gmail.com>
Description: The RCDC package implements Robust Covariate-Assisted Community
    Detection for multiple noisy observations of a latent true network with
    node-level covariates. It provides Markov chain Monte Carlo fitting
    routines, WAIC-based model selection, simulation utilities, and helper
    functions for robust community detection analyses.
